OL,3,GNEWSAPC who 'smashed man's head into
OL,4,Awall' dismissed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer who swung a drunk
OL,7,Fprisoner around with such force that he
OL,8,F"smashed his head into a wall" in a
OL,9,Fcustody suite at Newquay police station
OL,10,Fhas been dismissed.
OL,12,FPC Michael Ireland claimed that the
OL,13,Fman, who lost a tooth in the incident
OL,14,Fin January 2024, had "nutted" the door
OL,15,Fand "his face connected with the wall",
OL,16,Fa misconduct hearing was told.
OL,18,FIreland sprayed another person he
OL,19,Farrested in December 2023 with irritant
OL,20,Fspray and verbally abused him.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
