OL,5,
OL,6,FHe also grabbed a third drunk man by
OL,7,Fthe throat, put his finger in his face,
OL,8,Fused force on his legs, threatening to
OL,9,F"fold him in half in the back of the
OL,10,Fvan" before placing him in leg
OL,11,Frestraints, the hearing in Exeter
OL,12,Fheard.
